{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o037b","title":"刘璋增兵使刘备讨张鲁","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o037b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘璋增兵并令刘备督白水军以击张鲁，合军三万余人，供给丰厚。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o037b-q"]},{"id":"liuermu-a-bb7ebcb625385d9c6fb6","label":"正文","text":"刘璋资给刘备使讨张鲁","evidence":["liuermu-q-4874e64bfe1db5d47210","liuermu-q2-85a768fa64c4f0497f03"]},{"id":"liuermu-a-f10208e6697f3582a975","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"刘璋资送刘备","evidence":["liuermu-q-154d361dc970928aa2bc"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0253","role":"授兵","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o037b-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"领军","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o037b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"白水","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o037b-q"]},"time":{"year":211,"label":"涪会后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y211","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o034","basis":"涪会后"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o037b-q","xianzhu-q-o034","xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75"]},"source_order":[32,163,"O037b"],"order":6473}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0253","name":"刘璋","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liuermu-q-154d361dc970928aa2bc","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-6b47199700264fd57217","layer":"pei","quote":"璋以米二十万斛，骑千匹，车千乘，缯絮锦帛，以资送刘备","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0cc26102d942bc3fafb8","start":10,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q-4874e64bfe1db5d47210","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-cd2715048d75eb8ace1d","layer":"original","quote":"璋资给先主，使讨张鲁，然后分别","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":93,"end":108,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q2-85a768fa64c4f0497f03","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-cd2715048d75eb8ace1d","layer":"original","quote":"先主至江州〖21〗，北由垫江水，﹝五﹞诣涪〖22〗；﹝六﹞去成都三百六十里，是岁建安十六年也。璋率步骑三万余人，车乘帐幔，精光曜日，往就与会。先主所将将士，更相之适〖23〗，欢饮百余日。璋资给先主，使讨张鲁，然后分别。﹝七﹞","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o037b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-aea523871c19be481fd6","layer":"original","quote":"璋增先主兵，使击张鲁；又令督白水军〖3〗。先主并军三万余人，车甲器械资货甚盛。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-09400c250015597cdc75","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211 ）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8471d798647e2ff3307a","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-464a6d3ab5db13314b70","layer":"original","quote":"十六年〖10〗，益州牧刘璋，遥闻曹公将遣钟繇等向汉中讨张鲁，内怀恐惧。别驾从事蜀郡张松说璋曰：“曹公兵强，无敌于天下；若因张鲁之资以取蜀土〖11〗，谁能御之者乎？”璋曰：“吾固忧之而未有计。”松曰：“刘豫州，使君之宗室，而曹公之深仇也，善用兵；若使之讨鲁，鲁必破；鲁破，则益州强；曹公虽来，无能为也。”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":140,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
